 "traps": [
  "apps/remix is named after Remix but runs on React Router 7 framework mode (react-router, @react-router/*): no package of the repository declares a @remix-run package, so Remix is not a framework here",
  "the root package.json declares React, Zod, Prisma, tRPC, ts-rest, Inngest, Playwright and Vite for hoisting: they count for the root unit as well as for the packages that declare them",
  "packages/email/preview is a React Router and Vite app inside @documenso/email with no manifest of its own, so neither appears in that unit's dependencies",
  "packages/email and packages/ui get Tailwind CSS only through tailwind.config files and @documenso/tailwind-config",
  "playwright is a runtime dependency of @documenso/lib, which drives Chromium to render PDFs; the e2e tests use @playwright/test in @documenso/app-tests",
  "the jobs provider is chosen by NEXT_PRIVATE_JOBS_PROVIDER (local, inngest or bullmq), the mail transport by NEXT_PRIVATE_SMTP_TRANSPORT and storage by NEXT_PUBLIC_UPLOAD_TRANSPORT: every external service is optional and named only by its variable or SDK",
  "Gotenberg is built from docker/development/Dockerfile.gotenberg; its compose entry has an image name but no registry image",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
